WEBVTT

00:23:56.680 --> 00:24:03.196
And riding the helicopters at night --
open helicopters, by the way --

00:24:03.220 --> 00:24:04.796
flying at rooftop level

00:24:04.820 --> 00:24:07.246
to get from the airport
to the Green Zone --

00:24:07.270 --> 00:24:10.176
I thought was pretty exciting

00:24:10.200 --> 00:24:14.626
and not what I expected to be doing
when I was a little kid.

00:24:14.650 --> 00:24:17.821
AG: Carmen had already worked
for the CIA for more than a decade

00:24:17.845 --> 00:24:20.237
when the Cold War ended in 1989,

00:24:20.261 --> 00:24:23.206
and the agency started
undergoing a tectonic shift.

00:24:23.230 --> 00:24:26.490
CM: And I kept getting asked
to serve on task forces

00:24:27.556 --> 00:24:34.556
explicitly about how should the CIA
change and modify itself,